{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2109","id":2058014731,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz8856qtAL","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2109","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2109.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2109.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2109","number":2109,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Only load needed part of configuration","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently all configuration was loaded and validated regardless of what\r\nthe CLI was doing, if you did a `nodes ls` or `serve` the whole thing would\r\nbe loaded and validated which caused a machine that were doing only CLI\r\nstuff to need the full config, or at least a bunch that would throw errors.\r\n\r\nThis commit cleans up and splits this so that only the subset needed for\r\nrunning the CLI (unix socket or remote gRPC) is required when running\r\nall commands except for `serve`.\r\n\r\nWhen `serve` is ran, the normal chain with validations and loading of the\r\nwhole config is ran.\r\n\r\nThis means that deprecation warnings for the server config will only be shown\r\nin the server log.\r\n\r\nThis should be a nice quality of life improvements for users running headscale \r\nas a remote CLI, split config or Nix users with the module updates for 0.23.0 (https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/340054).\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\r\n\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n\t- Enhanced command-line interface (CLI) functionality, requiring minimal configuration for all commands except `serve`.\n\t- Improved configuration management with a streamlined approach using the `viper` package.\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n\t- Adjusted client initialization methods across multiple commands to enhance flexibility and reduce errors.\n\n- **Documentation**\n\t- Updated CHANGELOG.md to reflect significant improvements and changes in functionality.\n\n- **Tests**\n\t- Introduced new tests for TLS configuration validation to ensure compliance with expected settings.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2024-09-06T13:25:00Z","updated_at":"2024-09-07T07:23:59Z","closed_at":"2024-09-07T07:23:59Z","merged_at":"2024-09-07T07:23:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"8a3a0fee3ccbca7dd67b0d2965b523c8b6cb5451","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/starred{/owner}{